sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant API as FastAPI Route
    participant PlanService as PlanGenerationService
    participant Executor as ThreadPoolExecutor
    participant AICoach as AICoachService
    participant ChromaDB
    participant LLM as LLM Gateway
    participant PgVector as pgvector
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>+API: POST /plans/generate<br/>(preferences, duration_weeks)
    Note over API: JWT auth extracts user_id

    API->>+PlanService: generate_plan(profile, preferences)

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over PlanService,Executor: Step 1: Parallel AI Generation
        PlanService->>+Executor: submit(workout_task, nutrition_task)

        par Workout Generation
            Executor->>+AICoach: generate_workout_plan(profile, preferences)
        and Nutrition Generation
            Executor->>+AICoach: generate_nutrition_plan(profile, preferences)
        end

        Note over AICoach,LLM: Each task follows the same pipeline
        AICoach->>AICoach: context_builder: gather user context<br/>(profile, goals, injuries, conditions)
        AICoach->>+ChromaDB: RAG similarity search<br/>(evidence-based knowledge)
        ChromaDB-->>-AICoach: Relevant document chunks

        AICoach->>AICoach: prompt_builder: build structured prompt<br/>(user context + RAG context)

        AICoach->>+LLM: Generate plan via OpenRouter
        LLM-->>-AICoach: JSON response

        AICoach->>AICoach: plan_validator: validate structure
        AICoach->>AICoach: plan_judge: quality check

        AICoach-->>-Executor: WorkoutPlanDTO / NutritionPlanDTO
        AICoach-->>-Executor: (parallel result)
        Executor-->>-PlanService: Both plans ready
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over PlanService,DB: Step 2: Food & Exercise Matching
        PlanService->>+PgVector: Vector similarity search<br/>on CentralFood / exercises
        PgVector-->>-PlanService: Matched items with metadata
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over PlanService,DB: Step 3: Persist to Database
        PlanService->>+DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
        PlanService->>DB: INSERT workout_plan + days + exercises
        PlanService->>DB: INSERT nutrition_plan + meals + foods
        DB-->>-PlanService: COMMIT
    end

    PlanService-->>-API: CombinedPlanResponse
    API-->>-User: 201 Created<br/>{workout_plan, nutrition_plan}
